From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:22:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): keep toasts below the iOS status bar and Dynamic
 Island

Carried on custom until our upstream PR for this lands (not opened yet).

Toasts render top-center with sonner's fixed 16px/24px top gap, so in the
iOS app they sat under the status bar and Dynamic Island and could not be
read. The toaster already lifts its bottom edge above the home indicator
with --omnigent-inset-bottom; give the top edge the matching
--omnigent-inset-top. Desktop and Android without a top inset keep
sonner's default gaps.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Docs: none (layout fix: toasts clear the iOS status bar and Dynamic Island; nothing to configure)
---
 web/src/shell/AppShell.tsx | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/web/src/shell/AppShell.tsx b/web/src/shell/AppShell.tsx
index f4ec7bbe4cd773229c324713c45b8082e5b73032..26b79f4895477f1d679bc55255d3bc2864cb4a16 100644
--- a/web/src/shell/AppShell.tsx
+++ b/web/src/shell/AppShell.tsx
@@ -2892,11 +2892,14 @@ function AppShellImpl() {
           <Toaster
             position="top-center"
             visibleToasts={100}
+            // Top toasts start below the iOS status bar / Dynamic Island.
             offset={{
+              top: "calc(24px + var(--omnigent-inset-top))",
               right: "1rem",
               bottom: updateOverlayToastOffset(updateOverlayHeight),
             }}
             mobileOffset={{
+              top: "calc(16px + var(--omnigent-inset-top))",
               right: "1rem",
               bottom: updateOverlayToastOffset(updateOverlayHeight),
             }}
